{{!--
  Template for THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt. Regenerate after any Cargo.lock change, from the
  repository root, with cargo-about 0.9.3 (the version CI pins):

    cargo fetch --locked
    cargo about generate --frozen -m crates/revisor/Cargo.toml -c crates/revisor/about.toml crates/revisor/about.hbs -o crates/revisor/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt

  CI runs the same commands (adding --fail, which turns an unidentified licence into an
  error) and fails if the result differs from the committed file.

  cargo-about sees only Rust crates. The C and C++ code that wxdragon-sys compiles into the
  exe is listed by hand below; keep it in step with wxdragon-sys. With wxdragon's default
  features off, wxWidgets builds its own zlib, libpng, Expat and NanoSVG (wxUSE_* = builtin
  in its CMakeCache.txt) and leaves libjpeg, libtiff, PCRE2, libwebp and LunaSVG out. The
  texts are copied verbatim from the wxWidgets source tree wxdragon-sys downloads.
--}}
